==History==
2016
*The Golem [[Cards|card]] was added with Clash Royale's game launch on 4/1/2016 {{Balance|Add}}.
*On 2/2/2016, the [[Version History#February 2016 Update (2/2/2016)|February 2016 Update]], increased the Golem's hitpoints, attack damage and death damage by 43% {{Balance|Buff}}, and decreased the same stats on the Golemites by 43% {{Balance|Nerf}}. It also added the Death Damage statistic on the Golem's card info screen {{Balance|Add}}.
*On 19/2/2016, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (19/2/2016)|Balance Update]], decreased the Golem's and Golemites' hitpoints by 5% {{Balance|Nerf}}.
*On 29/2/2016, the [[Version History#March 2016 Update (29/2/2016)|March 2016 Update]], decreased the Golem's and its Golemites' sight range to 7 tiles (from 8 tiles) {{Balance|Buff}}. It also moved the [[Arenas|Arena]] to unlock the Golem from Royal Arena to Builder's Workshop {{Balance|Buff}}.
*On 3/5/2016, the [[Version History#May 2016 Update (3/5/2016)|May 2016 Update]], changed the Golem's appearance to include crystals on its back, removed the team-colored spiked collars from its neck {{Balance|Neutral}}, and changed the death animation of the Golem and the Golemites {{Balance|Neutral}}. The update also fixed the “range bug”, which decreased the Golem's range to 0.75 tiles (from 1.5 tiles) {{Balance|Nerf}}, but its effective range was unchanged. The Golemites' range was also decreased to 0.25 tiles (from 0.75 tiles) {{Balance|Nerf}}, but their effective range was unchanged.
*On 18/5/2016, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (18/5/2016)|Balance Update]], increased the Golem and Golemite's hitpoints by 5% {{Balance|Buff}}.
*On 24/8/2016, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (24/8/2016)|Balance Update]], increased the Golem's damage and death damage by 5% {{Balance|Buff}} and hitpoints by 1% {{Balance|Buff}}. The Golemites had their hit and death damage increased by 8% {{Balance|Buff}} and their hitpoints by 3.2% {{Balance|Buff}}.
*On 20/10/2016, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (20/10/2016)|Balance Update]], allowed the Golem's and its Golemites' death damage to affect flying [[:Category:Troop Cards|troops]] {{Balance|Neutral}}, but Supercell called it a bug fix.
2018
*On 20/6/2018, the [[Version History#Summer%202018%20Update%20(20/6/2018)|Summer 2018 Update]], moved the Arena to unlock the Golem from Builder's Workshop to Barbarian Bowl {{Balance|Buff}}.
*On 5/9/2018, the [[Version History#September%202018%20Update%20(5/9/2018)|September 2018 Update]], changed it so that {{Rarity|Epic}} cards start at Level 6 and end at Level 13 (from 1 to 8) {{Balance|Neutral}}.
2019
*On 7/1/2019, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (7/1/2019)|Balance Update]], decreased the Golemite's death pushback range to 0.9 tiles (from 1.8 tiles) {{Balance|Nerf}}.
2020
*On 3/3/2020, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (3/3/2020)|Balance Update]], decreased the Golemites' damage by 22.5% {{Balance|Nerf}}, but also increased their death damage by 55% {{Balance|Buff}}.
2021
*On 7/6/2021, the [[Version History#Summer%202021%20Update%20(7/6/2021)|Summer 2021 Update]], decreased the Golem's death damage by 28% {{Balance|Nerf}}. It also moved the Arena to unlock the Golem from Barbarian Bowl to Hog Mountain {{Balance|Nerf}}.
*On 27/10/2021, the [[Version History#Champions%20Update%20(27/10/2021)|Champions Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 14 (from 13) {{Balance|Buff}}.
2022
*On 15/12/2022, a [[Version History#Maintenance Break (15/12/2022)|maintenance break]], added a card render to the Golem's info screen {{Balance|Add}}.
2023
*On 27/3/2023, the [[Version History#Losers%20Update%20(27/3/2023)|Losers Update]], fixed a pathfinding issue related to Golem's sight range {{Balance|Neutral}}.
*On 19/6/2023, the [[Version History#Card%20Evolution%20Update%20(19/6/2023)|Card Evolution Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 15 (from 14) {{Balance|Buff}}.
2025
*On 31/3/2025, the [[Version History#2025 Quarter 1 Update (31/3/2025)|2025 Quarter 1 Update]], increased the Golem's death damage by 0.44% {{Balance|Buff}}. It also decreased the Golemites' hitpoints by 0.09% {{Balance|Nerf}} and their damage by 2.04% {{Balance|Nerf}}. The same update also fixed a bug where Golemites would not spawn after being buffed by [[Royal Chef]] {{Balance|Neutral}}.
*On 4/8/2025, the [[Version History/2025#Pass Royale and more (4/8/2025)|August 2025 Update]] increased the Golemite's damage by 74% {{Balance|Buff}}.

